  "description": "Gold price dashboard and intraday decision support for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI: SGE Au99.99 + XAU spot quotes, a draggable top-right floating board, CMB 积存金 live/international-converted fallback prices, fee-aware buy/sell suggestions, and host system/webhook alerts.",
